* List Price of Contemporary Commercial CAR-T Products: In the U.S. market, the current list prices (Wholesale Acquisition Cost) for autologous CAR-T cell products routinely range between $400,000 and $500,000 per individual infusion. This baseline figure excludes hospital markups, ancillary administrative fees, and specialized technical execution costs.
